{"page":472,"blocks":[{"x":0.04849,"y":0.05257,"w":0.293,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"458 Chapter 8: Techniques of Integration"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.09317,"w":0.25646,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 3 Evaluate the integral"},{"x":0.52152,"y":0.12616,"w":0.21018,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"(cos x sin 2x + sin x cos 2x) dx."},{"x":0.32331,"y":0.16819,"w":0.59308,"h":0.02899,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Solution Here we can replace the integrand with an equivalent trigonometric expression using the Sine Addition Formula to obtain a simple substitution:"},{"x":0.37194,"y":0.21568,"w":0.22311,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"(cos x sin 2x + sin x cos 2x) dx ="},{"x":0.62006,"y":0.21568,"w":0.11139,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(sin (x + 2x)) dx"},{"x":0.62006,"y":0.256,"w":0.05804,"h":0.01281,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"sin 3x dx"},{"x":0.62014,"y":0.28863,"w":0.25736,"h":0.02695,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"1 3 sin u du u = 3x, du = 3 dx"},{"x":0.58541,"y":0.32443,"w":0.03862,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"= - 1"},{"x":0.61585,"y":0.33079,"w":0.2677,"h":0.0206,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"3 cos 3x + C. Table 8.1, Formula 6"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.36984,"w":0.59299,"h":0.04348,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"In Section 5.5 we found the indefinite integral of the secant function by multiplying it by a fractional form identically equal to one, and then integrating the equivalent result. We can use that same procedure in other instances as well, which we illustrate next."},{"x":0.49761,"y":0.42486,"w":0.01871,"h":0.01626,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"p>4"},{"x":0.51643,"y":0.43808,"w":0.06868,"h":0.02729,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"dx 1 - sin x."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.44358,"w":0.15172,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 4 Find"},{"x":0.32331,"y":0.48663,"w":0.59295,"h":0.04434,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":1,"t":"Solution We multiply the numerator and denominator of the integrand by 1 + sin x, which is simply a multiplication by a form of the number one. This procedure transforms the integral into one we can evaluate:"},{"x":0.39742,"y":0.5374,"w":0.01871,"h":0.01626,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"p>4"},{"x":0.52122,"y":0.5374,"w":0.01871,"h":0.01626,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"p>4"},{"x":0.54004,"y":0.54884,"w":0.15642,"h":0.02967,"fs":0.01918,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"1 1 - sin x # 1 + sin x 1 + sin x dx"},{"x":0.41624,"y":0.55062,"w":0.10329,"h":0.03083,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"dx 1 - sin x = L"},{"x":0.52122,"y":0.58089,"w":0.01871,"h":0.01626,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"p>4"},{"x":0.54004,"y":0.59344,"w":0.08678,"h":0.02957,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"1 + sin x 1 - sin2 x dx"},{"x":0.52122,"y":0.62437,"w":0.01871,"h":0.01626,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"p>4"},{"x":0.54214,"y":0.63692,"w":0.08248,"h":0.02957,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"1 + sin x cos2 x dx"},{"x":0.52122,"y":0.66785,"w":0.01871,"h":0.01626,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"p>4"},{"x":0.73214,"y":0.68255,"w":0.09779,"h":0.02302,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Use Table 8.1, Formulas 8 and 10"},{"x":0.51386,"y":0.68379,"w":0.18515,"h":0.02859,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"0 (sec2 x + sec x tan x) dx"},{"x":0.60931,"y":0.71237,"w":0.01813,"h":0.0158,"fs":0.0087,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"p>4"},{"x":0.60931,"y":0.71593,"w":0.24604,"h":0.04038,"fs":0.01441,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"0 = 11 + 22 - (0 + 1)2 = 22."},{"x":0.48704,"y":0.72132,"w":0.11981,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"= c tan x + sec xd"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.77674,"w":0.17855,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 5 Evaluate"},{"x":0.58634,"y":0.79806,"w":0.08475,"h":0.03235,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"3x2 - 7x 3x + 2 dx."},{"x":0.06068,"y":0.84678,"w":0.13024,"h":0.07658,"fs":0.01261,"n":6,"k":0,"t":"x - 3 3x + 2)3x2 - 7x 3x2 + 2x -9x -9x - 6"},{"x":0.32334,"y":0.85177,"w":0.5931,"h":0.04434,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":1,"t":"Solution The integrand is an improper fraction since the degree of the numerator is greater than the degree of the denominator. To integrate it, we perform long division to obtain a quotient plus a remainder that is a proper fraction:"},{"x":0.51613,"y":0.90293,"w":0.20342,"h":0.03235,"fs":0.01279,"n":5,"k":0,"t":"3x2 - 7x 3x + 2 = x - 3 + 6 3x + 2."},{"x":0.16903,"y":0.92735,"w":0.02267,"h":0.01212,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"+ 6"}]}